    "date": "2024-04-01",
    "content": "# Claude\n\nClaude is a family of large language models developed by Anthropic, designed with safety and helpfulness as core principles. The models use Constitutional AI (CAI) training methodology.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Constitutional AI**: Trained using a set of principles to be helpful, harmless, and honest\n- **Large Context Window**: Supports up to 200,000 tokens, enabling analysis of very long documents\n- **Strong Reasoning**: Excels at complex analysis, writing, and coding tasks\n- **Multimodal**: Claude 3 models can process images alongside text\n\n## Constitutional AI\n\nAnthropic's Constitutional AI approach involves:\n\n1. **Self-Improvement**: The model critiques its own responses based on a set of principles\n2. **RLHF Alternative**: Reduces reliance on human feedback for alignment\n3. **Transparency**: The \"constitution\" governing the model's behavior is publicly available\n\n```python\n# Example API usage\nimport anthropic\n\nclient = anthropic.Anthropic()\nmessage = client.messages.create(\n    model=\"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\n    max_tokens=1024,\n    messages=[\n        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What are the key principles of Constitutional AI?\"}\n    ]\n)\n```\n\n## Model Variants\n\n| Model | Best For | Context Window |\n|-------|----------|----------------|\n| Claude 3.5 Sonnet | Balanced performance | 200K tokens |\n| Claude 3 Opus | Complex reasoning | 200K tokens |\n| Claude 3 Haiku | Fast, lightweight | 200K tokens |\n\n## Safety Features\n\nClaude includes several safety-oriented features:\n\n- **Refusal Training**: Declines to help with harmful or illegal activities\n- **Honesty**: Attempts to express uncertainty rather than guessing\n- **Transparency**: Explains its reasoning and limitations\n- **Privacy**: Designed to protect user data and privacy\n\n## Use Cases\n\nClaude is particularly well-suited for:\n\n- Document analysis and summarization\n- Code review and development\n- Research and academic work\n- Customer support\n- Creative writing",
